-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §96 ההמרה: every existing first deputy moves
-- to the reform's structure when it is applied in his school, and his pay
-- is converted.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `96 ההמרה`

@ref akn:art_96
GIVEN `an existing first deputy` IS A BOOLEAN, `the reform is applied in his school` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the first deputy moves to the reform` `an existing first deputy` `the reform is applied in his school` IF
    `an existing first deputy` AND `the reform is applied in his school`
